eds-usd583-billion-for-first-time-in-2025","url":"https://t.co/1xDWMi07av"}]},"id":"2111320005891719596","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":10005,"like_count":92,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":13},"text":"Yicai: \"Last year, China’s basic research spending ranked second worldwide after the United States and was about 2.3 times that of third-ranked Japan and 2.8 times that of fourth-ranked South Korea, the report also showed.\"\nhttps://t.co/1xDWMi07av","url":"https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2111320005891719596"},{"author_id":"917683048782503937","created_at":"2026-10-17T04:54:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111319978205225155"],"id":"2111319978205225155","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":45,"impression_count":16606,"like_count":192,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":29},"text":"Reuters: \"Changing diets at home and Beijing’s emphasis on food security have pushed companies to invest in technology and expansion. Now, they produce more than China can consume and are unloading excess production abroad.\"\n\nWhen a country's capacity is so obviously affected by","url":"https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2111319978205225155"},{"author_id":"917683048782503937","created_at":"2026-10-17T04:42:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111316994855522650"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"But exhibitors at Canton Fair say European market outlook clouded by regulatory and financial hurdles.","display_url":"sc.mp/k3im3?utm_sour…","end":250,"expanded_url":"https://sc.mp/k3im3?utm_source=twitter&utm_campaign=3371178&utm_medium=share_widget","images":[{"height":630,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111108608616505344/omOd37oR?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111108608616505344/omOd37oR?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":227,"title":"As tariff threats ease, US in fashion again among Chinese exporters","unwound_url":"https://www.scmp.com/economy/china-economy/article/3371178/tariff-threats-ease-us-fashion-again-among-chinese-exporters?utm_source=twitter&utm_campaign=3371178&utm_medium=share_widget","url":"https://t.co/GocPndGcUc"}]},"id":"2111316994855522650","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":8616,"like_count":41,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"SCMP: \"With the US set to lower tariffs on US$30 billion worth of shipments from China, Chinese exporters said this week they expected a new wave of orders from American buyers and planned to reactivate idle factory capacity.\"\nhttps://t.co/GocPndGcUc","url":"https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2111316994855522650"},{"author_id":"917683048782503937","created_at":"2026-10-17T04:33:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111314630907978084"],"id":"2111314630907978084","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":8371,"like_count":52,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":11},"text":"Caixin: \"The government is seeking to bring private companies into a massive infrastructure push centered on “six networks,” covering water, power, logistics, computing power, next-generation communications and urban underground pipelines. But the challenge is to create a","url":"https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2111314630907978084"},{"author_id":"917683048782503937","created_at":"2026-10-17T04:20:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111311269152366635"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"(Yicai) Oct. 16 -- China marked the second-lowest monthly level in non-bank deposits last month, while the spread between M2, a broad gauge of money supply that covers cash in circulation and all deposits, and M1, a narrow measure that covers cash in circulation and non-bank and non-government deposits, continued to increase. The sharp drop in non-bank deposits and the widening M2-M1 gap signal a slower shift in deposits amid capital market volatility, said Lin Yingqi, banking analyst at China Internationa","display_url":"yicaiglobal.com